immaginata di un leone.","fr":"Le Sahara apparaît dans une comparaison ludique entre un salon et la liberté imaginée d’un lion.","es":"El Sahara aparece en una comparación lúdica entre un salón y la libertad imaginada de un león."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"spain","collection":"cited","name":"Spain","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"a6920642ce9d8ebdba3d76d92ad56c127cc97f89d0e3e43bce3746958bb37608","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"A conversation turns to Saint-Simon’s account of his embassy to Spain.","it":"Una conversazione si sofferma sul racconto di Saint-Simon della sua ambasciata in Spagna.","fr":"Une conversation porte sur le récit par Saint-Simon de son ambassade en Espagne.","es":"Una conversación se detiene en el relato de Saint-Simon sobre su embajada en España."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"switzerland","collection":"cited","name":"Switzerland","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"a9e37ca9fae98708ebdc603b86529fb15912c0948ea95af080071bcba794fd85","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Old Swiss buildings at the foot of a mountain enter a comparison with Parisian architecture.","it":"Antichi edifici svizzeri ai piedi di una montagna entrano in un paragone con l’architettura parigina.","fr":"D’anciens bâtiments suisses au pied d’une montagne entrent dans une comparaison avec l’architecture parisienne.","es":"Antiguos edificios suizos al pie de una montaña entran en una comparación con la arquitectura parisina."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"thames","collection":"cited","name":"River Thames","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"2f2226e27f74b22b49deb635e4c190759fd26ceef9beeb6a392279847f64cb2c","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Odette refers to the English expression for a condescending manner by invoking the Thames.","it":"Odette richiama il Tamigi parlando dell’espressione inglese per un atteggiamento condiscendente.","fr":"Odette évoque la Tamise en parlant du mot anglais désignant une attitude condescendante.","es":"Odette evoca el Támesis al hablar de la expresión inglesa para una actitud condescendiente."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"trieste","collection":"cited","name":"Trieste","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"e734d73477280f8da847c9db2dd324975f86aaf2e96d5a2033464d0933e820bb","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Trieste is recalled as a place where Albertine’s older friend spent some of her happiest years.","it":"Trieste è ricordata come luogo in cui l’amica più anziana di Albertine ha trascorso alcuni dei suoi anni migliori.","fr":"Trieste est évoquée comme le lieu où l’amie plus âgée d’Albertine a passé certaines de ses plus belles années.","es":"Trieste se recuerda como el lugar donde la amiga mayor de Albertine pasó algunos de sus mejores años."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"versailles-city","collection":"cited","name":"Versailles","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"c186f2529573db4821022e1002bd20cc77de5472aec5d6253b3512ee7ab4f285","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Life at Versailles is used to compare the ceremonial habits of the court and the narrator’s household.","it":"La vita a Versailles è usata per paragonare le abitudini cerimoniali della corte e della casa del narratore.","fr":"La vie à Versailles sert à comparer les habitudes cérémonielles de la cour et de la maison du narrateur.","es":"La vida en Versalles sirve para comparar las costumbres ceremoniales de la corte y de la casa del narrador."}}},{"book":"proust","id":"vienna","collection":"cited","name":"Vienna","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"b4c23bdce87b2c7b2af7ced66bca893c164b33e0eb2e951b6f30c843e5af669f","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"An ambassador recalls Bergotte’s visit to Vienna and the difficulties of inviting him.","it":"Un ambasciatore ricorda la visita di Bergotte a Vienna e le difficoltà nell’invitarlo.","fr":"Un ambassadeur rappelle la visite de Bergotte à Vienne et la difficulté de l’inviter.","es":"Un embajador recuerda la visita de Bergotte a Viena y las dificultades para invitarlo."}}}]'::jsonb; expected integer := 25;
begin
 if (select count(*) from public.place_descriptions d join jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,"noteHash" text,"positionSource" text,"narrativeSource" text,description jsonb) on d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection where md5(coalesce(d.note,''))=x."noteHash" and d.position_source_id::text=x."positionSource" and d.narrative_source_id::text is not distinct from x."narrativeSource" and (not (coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb) ? 'positionDescription') or d.metadata->'positionDescription'=x.description)) <> expected then raise exception 'A source or summary changed; no updates applied'; end if;
 update public.place_descriptions d set metadata=jsonb_set(coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb),'{positionDescription}',x.description,true) from jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,description jsonb) where d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection;
end $revision$;
commit;
